    affiliation: "Technische Universität Berlin, Germany"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Randomidous/NeuroUrbanism-DB"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - EEG
  - neuroscience
  - architecture
  - urbanism
  - nature
  - biophilic design
  - systematic review
abstract: >-
  Curated, openly accessible database of empirical EEG studies investigating
  human neurophysiological responses to architectural, urban, and natural
  environments. Records include citation, sample, paradigm, EEG acquisition
  setup, analysis approach, mobility scoring, and replicability assessment.
